      \"background\": \"A sunny tropical seaside travel location with a clear blue sky, turquoise water, pale sand, and a softly blurred beach promenade in the distance. The background should feel real, warm, and vacation-like without distracting from the selfie subject.\",\n        \"elements\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [0, 0, 1024, 1024],\n                \"desc\": \"A vertical summer travel selfie composition, shot from a slightly elevated handheld smartphone angle. The frame captures the subject from the upper torso upward, with the beach and sea visible behind her.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#4DB7D8\", \"#FDF6E7\", \"#FFFFFF\"]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [260, 120, 760, 860],\n                \"desc\": \"A beautiful adult woman as the main subject, smiling naturally at the camera. She has fresh summer makeup, healthy glowing skin, wind-touched hair, and a relaxed vacation expression. Her pose is casual and confident, like a real travel selfie.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#F1C7A5\", \"#5C3327\", \"#FFFFFF\", \"#F2B36D\"]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [310, 470, 720, 900],\n                \"desc\": \"Light summer travel outfit, such as a white linen shirt or sleeveless sundress, paired with simple jewelry and sunglasses either worn on the head or held casually in one hand.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#FFFFFF\", \"#FDF6E7\", \"#D8B98A\", \"#2F2F2F\"]\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"obj\",\n                \"bbox\": [40, 80, 980, 520],\n                \"desc\": \"Bright blue sky and tropical sunlight with a subtle warm lens flare near the top edge. The sky should look natural and photographic, not graphic or illustrated.\",\n                \"color_palette\": [\"#4DB7D8\", \"#AEE6F2\", \"#FFFFFF\"]\n           